outcome = SubResource("Resource_tjq03")
outcome_text = "Fearing for the chick's odds of survival, the surveyors decide to return it to the nest.

One of them gently picks up the chick, wraps it in a cloth, and climbs up the tree.

The adult hawk flies away and starts circling above, letting the scout safely deposit the chick."

